queria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","review_id":"1HzeijXbWls5lXMSo7BHFA","date":"2019-07-10T23:36:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9524308443069458,"text_excerpt":"Throughly enjoyed my second time cigar smoking with the Yelp NOLA squad! The cigars were rich in flavor and the whisky was top notch. This was a super laid back and chill event. The leather chairs were super comfy the tables were also super cool. I enjoyed the dim lighting where we located in the back, definitely set the vibe! Very relaxed and such a cool ambiance. Our host was super knowledgeable and taught us a bunch of fun facts about the building itself (which used to serve as a bathhouse) as well as about the cigars and whiskey we were consuming. This spot has some pretty cool history, like many places in the French Quarter, which is why I think it stands out. Its pretty cool that Cu..."},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","review_id":"R7ht0fLompUwd4qmChKOzQ","date":"2019-10-01T20:37:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.941046953201294,"text_excerpt":"My first time here was an event hosted by Yelp! It was impressive. After a return visit I was greeted by The Hostess who was very attentive and wanted to know if I needed assistance with a cigar storage locker, a first time cigar smoker, viewing any game(s), wanted to sit at the bar or needed her to bring a drink from the bar all the while escorting to that customized spot. As I took a seat, The perfect Sazerac was brought to my seat, cigar was cut and lit and left I disturbed to watch my football. Can I just live here?! I'm not a cigar enthusiast but every once In awhile I come to relax. My second time I came with a group; PERFECT! Spacious area I'll just call The Living Room where sofas..."},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","review_id":"lxRxOghSC4rn4TQksQ_V9Q","date":"2019-07-10T01:56:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369330406188965,"text_excerpt":"Had a really great experience at this cigar bar. I have only been to one other that allowed you to smoke inside. This place offers a full bar as well as a few small bites Being a part of the Yelp event we learned the basics of cigar smoking and tasted a few scotches featuring MaCallan Whiskey 2,3 and 12 which sell for about $130 a bottle and $30-40 a shot. AMAZING. They also made us a delicious old fashioned. The general manager Kevin was great and also led the experience. We were informed that they offer events that can suit anyone. My husband is planning his return for next week! This place will become a regular spot for us. Cozy, great history and overall great experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","photo_id":"suEl4JZNHnSYyBNAc8s8-A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/suEl4JZNHnSYyBNAc8s8-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8572962284088135},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","photo_id":"mGpki6ffTL4byL3vIqIOeA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mGpki6ffTL4byL3vIqIOeA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.835854172706604},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","photo_id":"O_ip7miO6RwoSZGy56mcKA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/O_ip7miO6RwoSZGy56mcKA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8222435712814331},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","photo_id":"fdZOinw3tbpFUOKl0EqzhA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fdZOinw3tbpFUOKl0EqzhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8079859018325806},{"business_id":"pDZWkTn-8qja2C4sZ6CLFA","photo_id":"KwDMJhpJcFjXW6Igv5_TEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/KwDMJhpJcFjXW6Igv5_TEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7992815375328064}]},"notebook_case":null}
